WEBVTT

00:00:15.845 --> 00:00:22.875
Tell me nanimo wakaranai no demo
Tell me I don't
understand anything, but

00:00:23.055 --> 00:00:30.045
You say itsumo sonna kotoba mo
You always say those
kinds of words, too

00:00:31.025 --> 00:00:37.795
Surechigau dake no
You find another way
You find another way where
we only pass each other by

00:00:38.265 --> 00:00:44.935
Owatteku sekai wo tobidashite
You know?
And rush out into a world
that's ending, you know?

00:00:45.245 --> 00:00:50.765
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:00:51.085 --> 00:00:54.485
Hikari yori hayaku
Faster than light,

00:00:55.255 --> 00:00:59.275
monokuro no supiido de
with monochromic speed

00:00:59.555 --> 00:01:05.115
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:01:05.325 --> 00:01:08.885
Jikan yori tooku
Farther than time,

00:01:09.665 --> 00:01:14.435
kakenukeru
You're so far away
I run through it;
you're so far away

00:01:30.115 --> 00:01:34.815
Trap of the Steaming Hot Water

00:01:36.525 --> 00:01:40.515
Rena! Rena!

00:01:41.195 --> 00:01:42.225
Rena!

00:01:46.965 --> 00:01:51.265
Man, where the heck did Rena go?

00:01:51.445 --> 00:01:52.775
Shugo!

00:01:54.345 --> 00:01:56.405
Hey, Shugo!

00:01:56.675 --> 00:01:57.505
Rena!

00:01:58.545 --> 00:01:59.915
Shugo.

00:02:00.485 --> 00:02:02.475
Rena!

00:02:05.085 --> 00:02:05.845
It can't be.

00:02:26.075 --> 00:02:27.265
It's no good.

00:02:27.645 --> 00:02:30.975
There are no traces of Rena here.

00:02:31.485 --> 00:02:32.575
What about you?

00:02:33.385 --> 00:02:36.145
I cannot find Rena's ghost.

00:02:44.095 --> 00:02:46.395
Don't look so sad.

00:02:46.695 --> 00:02:48.895
Shugo, please cheer up.

00:02:49.095 --> 00:02:52.295
Man, what's going on here?

00:02:52.665 --> 00:02:54.865
She won't pick up
the phone in real life.

00:02:55.175 --> 00:02:57.605
We can't find her ghost anywhere.

00:02:58.005 --> 00:02:58.735
Certainly...

00:02:58.945 --> 00:03:00.605
...it's difficult to think
of it as being normal.

00:03:00.775 --> 00:03:02.145
Sanjuro...

00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:05.305
...had a serious expression
on his face when he left.

00:03:06.285 --> 00:03:07.545
Maybe she is in another area?

00:03:08.555 --> 00:03:11.175
Yes, yes! I know!

00:03:11.725 --> 00:03:12.915
Mireille.

00:03:13.425 --> 00:03:15.695
Do you normally
search under the floor?

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:16.915
What do you know?

00:03:17.195 --> 00:03:18.425
What do you know?

00:03:21.865 --> 00:03:23.665
A special event?

00:03:24.565 --> 00:03:25.435
That's right.

00:03:25.535 --> 00:03:27.935
There's no other possible explanation.

00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:29.995
I wonder.

00:03:32.445 --> 00:03:37.205
From my experience in
"The World", it has to be that.

00:03:37.515 --> 00:03:41.005
All of this unusual stuff
happens around Shugo.

00:03:41.355 --> 00:03:44.545
Well, if you put it that way. I guess.

00:03:45.055 --> 00:03:46.285
That must be it.

00:03:46.925 --> 00:03:48.415
We've looked all over for her.

00:03:49.125 --> 00:03:52.185
It could be that Rena
is in another area.

00:03:52.465 --> 00:03:56.485
Everyone, let's go find Rena.

00:03:56.895 --> 00:03:59.425
Then we'll clear the event.

00:03:59.705 --> 00:04:01.965
And we'll get some fabulous rare item!

00:04:02.235 --> 00:04:04.565
At least you could be a little worried.

00:04:04.645 --> 00:04:07.435
It's a special event! A special event!

00:04:14.285 --> 00:04:19.415
Now, let's start the plan
to save the lost Rena!

00:04:20.125 --> 00:04:22.145
For now, I'll go to the information...

00:04:22.295 --> 00:04:23.955
...shop to check for
information on Rena.

00:04:24.355 --> 00:04:26.955
Everyone else, search
for her in the city.

00:04:27.465 --> 00:04:28.795
Search?

00:04:28.895 --> 00:04:30.055
Let's go!

00:04:31.805 --> 00:04:32.325
We're going!

00:04:32.435 --> 00:04:32.995
Eh?

00:04:33.365 --> 00:04:34.895
Where are we going?

00:04:35.805 --> 00:04:36.965
To get information.

00:04:37.905 --> 00:04:38.875
R... right!

00:04:41.745 --> 00:04:42.335
That's right.

00:04:42.775 --> 00:04:44.575
Rena is styled after a famous...

00:04:44.785 --> 00:04:47.275
...player character named BlackRose.

00:04:47.785 --> 00:04:50.015
Someone must have seen her.

00:04:50.385 --> 00:04:52.215
Wait for me, Rena!

00:04:53.425 --> 00:04:56.155
A player character
styled after BlackRose?

00:04:56.195 --> 00:04:57.685
There's someone like that?

00:05:01.265 --> 00:05:02.195
I don't know.

00:05:02.595 --> 00:05:03.565
I can't say.

00:05:04.235 --> 00:05:05.825
Tres Bien!

00:05:06.165 --> 00:05:07.655
Me thinks that is Shugo Kunisaki!

00:05:07.705 --> 00:05:09.795
That means my beloved Rena is...

00:05:26.025 --> 00:05:27.575
Rena!

00:05:29.325 --> 00:05:30.915
She's not here.

00:05:30.955 --> 00:05:32.015
BlackRose?

00:05:32.465 --> 00:05:34.085
Yeah, well.

00:05:34.665 --> 00:05:36.165
Earlier at the park over there.

00:05:36.165 --> 00:05:36.655
Let's go!

00:05:36.695 --> 00:05:37.855
Yeah!

00:05:42.875 --> 00:05:45.675
I'd heard of rumors of
a player character...

00:05:45.675 --> 00:05:49.205
...that looked like BlackRose
here in "The World".

00:05:57.555 --> 00:06:00.185
W... where is she?

00:06:00.625 --> 00:06:02.645
So this was the last place?

00:06:03.995 --> 00:06:06.985
I have a thought.

00:06:07.625 --> 00:06:08.785
A thought?

00:06:08.865 --> 00:06:09.995
It's...

00:06:10.365 --> 00:06:11.095
It's?

00:06:11.305 --> 00:06:13.705
It's the grunty.

00:06:17.305 --> 00:06:18.435
The grunty?

00:06:18.605 --> 00:06:19.505
I was thinking of giving...

00:06:19.705 --> 00:06:22.075
...the grunty Rena's
scent to search with.

00:06:22.475 --> 00:06:24.675
Can it do that?

00:06:24.985 --> 00:06:26.145
It should be fine.

00:06:26.485 --> 00:06:28.645
The grunty has grown up.

00:06:28.915 --> 00:06:31.815
I see. Grunties are animals.

00:06:32.225 --> 00:06:34.215
They have a better sense
of smell than we do.

00:06:34.625 --> 00:06:36.455
Go forth! Grunty!

00:06:36.555 --> 00:06:39.115
Now is the time you
prove your usefulness!

00:06:39.625 --> 00:06:41.995
Take us to Rena!

00:07:16.495 --> 00:07:18.265
Don't go to sleep!!

00:07:23.035 --> 00:07:25.805
Man. That was useless!!

00:07:26.275 --> 00:07:27.795
An animal?

00:07:28.345 --> 00:07:31.575
We have an even better animal!

00:07:36.055 --> 00:07:37.915
I am NOT a dog!

00:07:50.235 --> 00:07:51.355
You're late.

00:07:51.835 --> 00:07:53.965
You were the one that called me.

00:07:54.335 --> 00:07:57.275
My apologies.
I was looking into something.

00:07:57.975 --> 00:07:58.995
Looking into something?

00:07:59.575 --> 00:08:00.635
That's unlike you.

00:08:01.305 --> 00:08:02.975
I had no choice.

00:08:03.975 --> 00:08:05.875
So what brings you here?

00:08:06.585 --> 00:08:07.745
BlackRose.

00:08:08.815 --> 00:08:10.585
Rena has disappeared.

00:08:12.925 --> 00:08:13.945
To be precise...

00:08:14.155 --> 00:08:15.915
...when she was killed by Death...

00:08:16.325 --> 00:08:18.555
...she disappeared without
becoming a ghost.

00:08:18.695 --> 00:08:21.215
That can't happen! There's no way.

00:08:27.335 --> 00:08:28.425
Sanjuro.

00:08:29.635 --> 00:08:32.125
There is one thing I know.

00:08:33.605 --> 00:08:35.545
She's nowhere to be found.

00:08:36.815 --> 00:08:38.335
Where is Rena?

00:08:38.845 --> 00:08:40.905
This calls for an in-depth search!

00:08:41.615 --> 00:08:43.375
Rena!

00:08:46.655 --> 00:08:47.785
Rena!

00:08:52.965 --> 00:08:54.255
Rena...

00:09:08.575 --> 00:09:09.635
Rena.

00:09:10.975 --> 00:09:12.465
Come to think of it...

00:09:13.615 --> 00:09:16.175
She used to get lost a lot.

00:09:34.335 --> 00:09:36.465
Rena! Rena!

00:09:38.975 --> 00:09:40.105
Shugo!

00:09:43.645 --> 00:09:44.835
Shugo!

00:09:46.945 --> 00:09:48.105
Shugo.

00:09:48.985 --> 00:09:50.545
Hm? What?

00:09:50.615 --> 00:09:52.125
Just say something.

00:09:52.125 --> 00:09:54.485
Huh? Um...

00:09:55.495 --> 00:09:58.115
A cute puppy fell in the river.

00:09:58.825 --> 00:09:59.625
SPLASH!

00:10:00.565 --> 00:10:02.125
Silly Shugo!

00:10:09.135 --> 00:10:10.575
Big brother!

00:10:11.435 --> 00:10:14.875
Big Brother! Big Brother!

00:10:15.315 --> 00:10:16.605
Big Brother.

00:10:16.915 --> 00:10:21.245
Hey, big brother!
Talk about something.

00:10:26.055 --> 00:10:29.085
Rena!

00:10:29.295 --> 00:10:30.455
I thought so.

00:10:30.755 --> 00:10:32.955
Put your heart into it
and call out for her.

00:10:36.535 --> 00:10:37.695
Found him!

00:10:38.335 --> 00:10:40.525
There's no mistake, it's Kite.

00:10:40.935 --> 00:10:42.875
He's searching here of all places?

00:10:43.105 --> 00:10:45.035
Because of a miscalculation last time...

00:10:45.245 --> 00:10:48.105
...we killed BlackRose instead of Kite.

00:10:48.245 --> 00:10:49.305
This is good.

00:10:49.515 --> 00:10:51.635
Kite's lost his friend so
his heart is wide open...

00:10:51.815 --> 00:10:53.475
...for sure.

00:10:53.615 --> 00:10:55.345
Then leave it to me.

00:10:55.585 --> 00:10:57.175
It'll go smoothly this time.

00:10:57.215 --> 00:10:58.875
You have some kind of plan?

00:10:59.385 --> 00:11:02.725
Yeah. He'll be completely
deletable now.

00:11:03.625 --> 00:11:06.285
He won't even have
the time to Data Drain.

00:11:17.305 --> 00:11:20.365
I see. There was no trail.

00:11:21.045 --> 00:11:23.475
Yeah. What about you, Mireille?

00:11:23.775 --> 00:11:24.905
Empty handed.

00:11:25.015 --> 00:11:26.815
There wasn't any special
event information.

00:11:27.215 --> 00:11:29.415
No one has seen Rena.

00:11:30.185 --> 00:11:30.675
Yeah.

00:11:31.555 --> 00:11:33.955
So there was no special event.

00:11:34.155 --> 00:11:36.085
Then, where's Rena?

00:11:36.625 --> 00:11:39.825
Ah, she might have just logged out.

00:11:40.065 --> 00:11:42.295
She might have just
gotten hopelessly lost.

00:11:42.695 --> 00:11:44.135
It will be all right.

00:11:44.235 --> 00:11:45.355
Even if you die in the game...

00:11:45.505 --> 00:11:47.195
...you won't die in the real world.

00:11:47.665 --> 00:11:50.575
How can you say that with a smile?!

00:11:50.735 --> 00:11:51.895
"Act?"

00:11:52.245 --> 00:11:54.205
Movie. Play at?

00:11:54.305 --> 00:11:54.795
Huh?

00:11:54.905 --> 00:11:56.135
This is strange.

00:11:56.245 --> 00:11:58.645
I thought for sure that it was an event.

00:11:58.885 --> 00:12:01.345
Something must have happened.

00:12:03.985 --> 00:12:06.615
What's wrong Shugo?

00:12:06.925 --> 00:12:07.785
Mail.

00:12:07.825 --> 00:12:09.885
It's Rena right. It's from Rena, right?

00:12:10.255 --> 00:12:13.225
Sender Unknown.

00:12:13.825 --> 00:12:14.965
Unknown?

00:12:14.965 --> 00:12:17.295
So, what does it say?

00:12:17.635 --> 00:12:21.325
"Greedy Her Furnace".
What does that mean?

00:12:21.435 --> 00:12:22.635
It's an area name!

00:12:22.775 --> 00:12:23.825
I'm sure of it.

00:12:24.775 --> 00:12:27.075
So it was a special event!

00:12:28.645 --> 00:12:29.765
Really?

00:12:30.375 --> 00:12:32.205
A friend suddenly goes missing.

00:12:32.745 --> 00:12:35.805
Then a mail, with no
known sender comes in...

00:12:36.415 --> 00:12:38.715
...with an area name in it.

00:12:39.325 --> 00:12:40.015
In other words.

00:12:40.655 --> 00:12:42.855
It's something that
ordinary players can't see...

00:12:42.855 --> 00:12:46.345
...the ultimate special event!

00:12:47.225 --> 00:12:48.095
I just know it!

00:12:48.465 --> 00:12:50.155
If I go there, Rena will...

00:12:50.335 --> 00:12:52.925
A dramatic meeting awaits you!

00:12:53.465 --> 00:12:55.235
I see!

00:12:55.435 --> 00:12:59.035
After all I did get the
gallant legendary hero.

00:12:59.305 --> 00:13:00.635
And a dramatic meeting...

00:13:00.745 --> 00:13:04.545
...worthy of such a hero awaits us.

00:13:04.845 --> 00:13:06.315
Never fear, "The World"!

00:13:06.885 --> 00:13:07.575
Alright!

00:13:08.045 --> 00:13:11.455
Let's go!
To "Greedy Kite Crossdresser".

00:13:25.565 --> 00:13:28.835
It looks like it's going
to get really cold.

00:13:30.135 --> 00:13:31.075
Ohka!

00:13:31.475 --> 00:13:33.635
You're the only one with a fur coat!

00:13:39.185 --> 00:13:40.445
It sure looks cold.

00:13:40.445 --> 00:13:42.475
I feel sorry for Rena.

00:13:43.085 --> 00:13:45.675
To be alone in such
a cold place like this.

00:13:46.225 --> 00:13:46.985
Rena.

00:13:49.155 --> 00:13:50.745
It- It'll be all right.

00:13:50.995 --> 00:13:53.725
She's more with it than she seems.

00:14:11.175 --> 00:14:11.735
Huh?

00:14:13.185 --> 00:14:14.315
That's...

00:14:14.315 --> 00:14:15.475
What, what?

00:14:16.015 --> 00:14:18.075
It's sort of smoky so I can't really tell.

00:14:18.385 --> 00:14:20.615
If it's a monster, leave it to me.

00:14:20.925 --> 00:14:22.155
Hurry up, let's go.

00:14:27.495 --> 00:14:28.655
A hot spring?

00:14:28.895 --> 00:14:30.335
What is this doing here?

00:14:30.695 --> 00:14:32.965
This is a... hot spring?

00:14:33.805 --> 00:14:34.765
Lucky!

00:14:35.405 --> 00:14:36.875
Hey, hey! Let's get in, let's get in!

00:14:37.275 --> 00:14:39.435
When you're cold, a
bath is the best thing!

00:14:39.975 --> 00:14:42.465
W-We're looking for Rena.

00:14:42.945 --> 00:14:44.935
Now's not the time
for a hot spring bath!

00:14:45.145 --> 00:14:45.905
Why not?

00:14:46.185 --> 00:14:48.115
We're probably the only
ones in "The World"...

00:14:48.315 --> 00:14:49.745
...that can enjoy a Hot Spring!

00:14:50.055 --> 00:14:53.415
We can't let such a rare chance go by!

00:14:53.455 --> 00:14:54.615
Listen here.

00:14:54.955 --> 00:14:56.985
Could it possibly be... Could it be...

00:14:57.195 --> 00:14:58.855
You're embarrassed?

00:14:58.895 --> 00:15:00.415
N- No way!

00:15:00.465 --> 00:15:01.895
I-I'm just afraid of mixed bathing...

00:15:01.995 --> 00:15:03.465
...how can I go into a
Outdoor Hot Spring?

00:15:03.995 --> 00:15:04.725
Well then...

00:15:05.735 --> 00:15:07.755
...would you like join
me in there, naked?

00:15:20.085 --> 00:15:22.745
Aaaah.
What a nice Outdoor Hot Spring.

00:15:22.785 --> 00:15:25.275
A moment to relax and
forget the fighting.

00:15:25.385 --> 00:15:27.285
I feel as if my heart
has been cleansed.

00:15:27.955 --> 00:15:30.655
Cleanse your heart?
How do you cleanse it?

00:15:30.825 --> 00:15:32.345
Do you use shampoo?

00:15:33.495 --> 00:15:34.855
Would you like to try?

00:15:37.065 --> 00:15:40.505
Shugo, come closer.

00:15:40.765 --> 00:15:42.165
This is just a game!

00:15:42.235 --> 00:15:45.105
It's not like we're really
seeing each other naked!

00:15:46.775 --> 00:15:48.265
That's true.

00:15:49.175 --> 00:15:51.575
A hero should be more impressive!

00:15:52.515 --> 00:15:56.245
Wow! You have such
a nice body, Ohka!

00:15:56.615 --> 00:15:57.775
Is that so?

00:16:00.825 --> 00:16:03.255
O- Ohka!
What are you doing?!

00:16:07.595 --> 00:16:09.295
Did I do something wrong?

00:16:09.335 --> 00:16:11.595
Grunty there you are.

00:16:12.235 --> 00:16:14.535
It seems to like Shugo very much.

00:16:15.065 --> 00:16:16.265
It looks like a good match.

00:16:46.505 --> 00:16:47.665
Rena!

00:16:49.675 --> 00:16:50.765
Shugo.

00:16:51.505 --> 00:16:53.905
W-Where were you?

00:16:54.975 --> 00:16:57.845
Sorry for worrying you.

00:16:58.575 --> 00:17:00.345
We looked for you all over the place.

00:17:01.015 --> 00:17:04.885
I believed in you.

00:17:05.685 --> 00:17:06.845
For sure.

00:17:09.055 --> 00:17:11.455
That you would come for me, Shugo.

00:17:16.895 --> 00:17:17.795
W-wait... Rena!

00:17:18.035 --> 00:17:20.505
Ah! I got the point- I got the point!

00:17:20.865 --> 00:17:22.735
A reunion at an outdoor hot spring.

00:17:23.075 --> 00:17:26.375
You wouldn't think they were
siblings with such an embrace.

00:17:26.575 --> 00:17:28.065
It's a beautiful sight.

00:17:28.205 --> 00:17:30.675
Well, it's a relief at any rate.

00:17:31.575 --> 00:17:34.175
I'm so glad. I'm glad I waited.

00:17:35.415 --> 00:17:37.215
I've been waiting all this time.

00:17:37.955 --> 00:17:40.115
For you to come, Shugo.

00:17:42.955 --> 00:17:44.785
Who are you?

00:17:46.895 --> 00:17:48.485
Eh? What are you talking about?

00:17:48.525 --> 00:17:49.465
I'm Rena.

00:17:50.095 --> 00:17:51.225
You're not.

00:17:54.135 --> 00:17:55.295
Shugo.

00:17:58.105 --> 00:17:59.195
I mean...

00:17:59.275 --> 00:18:01.205
Rena would never say such things.

00:18:01.475 --> 00:18:02.175
Rena would...

00:18:02.275 --> 00:18:04.545
...never just wait
around and do nothing!

00:18:05.315 --> 00:18:06.745
You're mean!

00:18:07.245 --> 00:18:08.775
You're not Rena.

00:18:09.315 --> 00:18:10.245
Rena is...

00:18:10.315 --> 00:18:13.285
Why? Why won't you believe me?

00:18:14.885 --> 00:18:18.885
Why? Why? Shugo!

00:18:22.865 --> 00:18:24.625
Big brother Shugo!

00:18:25.035 --> 00:18:26.625
The hot springs are gone!

00:18:26.665 --> 00:18:28.655
An illusion? Then!

00:18:28.975 --> 00:18:30.935
Hug me more.

00:18:31.175 --> 00:18:33.105
Girai Don!

00:18:35.975 --> 00:18:37.175
If you're going to save me...

00:18:37.315 --> 00:18:39.275
...do a better job of it.

00:18:40.015 --> 00:18:42.775
Don't be so fussy about
how you're saved.

00:18:43.155 --> 00:18:44.985
It's not my fault if you catch a cold.

00:18:48.125 --> 00:18:49.485
It's one of those remodeled monsters.

00:18:52.365 --> 00:18:53.695
Why in the?!

00:19:01.965 --> 00:19:03.095
W-What's that?!

00:19:19.425 --> 00:19:22.485
Do your best, Shugo!

00:19:22.695 --> 00:19:23.455
Unforgivable!

00:19:23.795 --> 00:19:26.785
For such a monster to
transform into Rena!

00:19:29.265 --> 00:19:31.565
Shugo! Farewell!

00:19:31.895 --> 00:19:33.695
The one going farewell is you!

00:19:33.835 --> 00:19:35.395
That's the punishment
for disgracing Rena!

00:19:35.675 --> 00:19:37.665
Data Drain!

00:19:47.115 --> 00:19:49.705
Just a bit overdone.

00:19:50.255 --> 00:19:53.085
Aaah, my skill points are drying up!

00:20:05.505 --> 00:20:07.295
It was all for nothing after all.

00:20:07.665 --> 00:20:09.765
Who was that mail from?

00:20:09.875 --> 00:20:10.665
Like I said.

00:20:10.805 --> 00:20:14.435
The special event's only
just started after all.

00:20:16.245 --> 00:20:18.235
Ah! It's you.

00:20:19.245 --> 00:20:20.685
Rena has disappeared, it seems?

00:20:21.185 --> 00:20:23.445
H-how did you know?

00:20:23.555 --> 00:20:25.415
Did you guys take Rena?

00:20:25.855 --> 00:20:27.255
In relation to that...

00:20:27.455 --> 00:20:30.545
...there is something I
must tell you, Shugo.

00:20:31.095 --> 00:20:32.715
It's related to the...

00:20:33.495 --> 00:20:34.655
...Kite and BlackRose...

00:20:34.995 --> 00:20:37.025
Character Present Campaign.

00:20:37.365 --> 00:20:38.355
Huh?

00:20:38.495 --> 00:20:39.595
That campaign was not...

00:20:39.905 --> 00:20:42.265
...run by the CC Corporation.

00:20:42.775 --> 00:20:43.665
It was set up by...

00:20:43.975 --> 00:20:45.905
...someone outside of the corporation.

00:20:46.875 --> 00:20:48.065
What does that mean?

00:20:48.375 --> 00:20:50.005
How do you know that?

00:20:50.275 --> 00:20:51.105
Because we are...

00:20:51.375 --> 00:20:53.675
...System Administrators
for CC Corporation.

00:20:54.315 --> 00:20:55.905
System Administrators?

00:20:56.085 --> 00:20:57.775
Lord Balmung is?

00:21:00.585 --> 00:21:03.425
Shugo, this is not some kind of event.

00:21:03.725 --> 00:21:04.855
Eh?!

00:21:07.795 --> 00:21:08.955
It's an incident!

00:21:24.245 --> 00:21:25.375
Hello.

00:21:26.315 --> 00:21:27.405
Mom?!

00:21:28.445 --> 00:21:30.075
Eh, What?!

00:21:43.095 --> 00:21:45.565
Rena!

00:21:50.175 --> 00:21:50.635
Preview

00:21:50.635 --> 00:21:52.745
Preview
I have information for inquiring minds!

00:21:52.745 --> 00:21:52.845
Preview

00:21:52.845 --> 00:21:56.045
Preview
The Heavy Blade named
Rena has fallen into a coma.

00:21:56.045 --> 00:21:56.345
Preview

00:21:56.345 --> 00:21:56.975
Preview
Huh? Could that be...

00:21:56.975 --> 00:21:58.415
Huh? Could that be...

00:21:58.715 --> 00:22:01.915
Rena is here! Hurry up, Shugo!

00:22:02.215 --> 00:22:04.985
Twilight Moon

00:22:06.625 --> 00:22:17.055
Hashitteyuku kodomotachi
no hashagu warai goe ni
In the running
children's frolicking voices

00:22:17.465 --> 00:22:24.965
Hikari to kage oikakete mitaku naru
They want to chase
the light and shadows

00:22:28.275 --> 00:22:38.705
Midori no ha ni sukashite
mita ano taiyou no saki ni
Watching the sun shine
between the green leaves,

00:22:39.025 --> 00:22:47.795
Nani ga aru to omotteita no darou
wondering if something is there.

00:22:49.135 --> 00:22:59.335
Emerald Green hana wo
tsunda te no naka kara
From inside the hands picking,
the emerald green flowers

00:22:59.775 --> 00:23:10.275
Sora kaze tsuchi e to
sugata wo kaeteyuku
change their body to the
sky, the wind, the ground.

00:23:10.555 --> 00:23:22.485
Sono utsukushisa ni me wo
hiraita mabushi sugiru basho de
Laying in that opulent place that
opened its eyes to that beauty,

00:23:22.835 --> 00:23:30.435
Nekoronda sora ni toikaketeru
Asking questions to the sky
